    var aboutBody: String {
        t(
        "Text: Sri Harikathamrutha Sara by Sri Jagannatha Dasaru, from the Tadipatri Gurukula Kannada script (Shri Kesava Rao Tadipatri, proof reading and padaccheda). The dashes are silent pauses: they mark the beat, not a stop.",
